#: ../../tools/openaire_dataset_tools.rst:32 bdb5d33b02564f7d9bc1d413f3d91056
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search OpenAIRE for research datasets from the European "
"open science ecosystem. Covers datasets from EU-funded projects (Horizon "
"2020, Horizon Europe), national repositories (Zenodo, DANS, Dryad, "
"Figshare), and thousands of data archives across Europe. Complements "
"DataGov\\_search\\_datasets (US federal data) with European and "
"international research datasets. Supports filtering by funder (EC, NIH, "
"NSF, ARC, etc.) and country (ISO 2-letter code)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/openaire_dataset_tools.rst:34 e55f75b4decc45b19d597008f914dfa3
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/openaire_dataset_tools.rst:36 a283cd931cea4a258b6184522fbc114a
msgid ""
"``keywords`` (string) (required) Search keywords for dataset discovery. "
"Searches across titles, descriptions, and subjects."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/openaire_dataset_tools.rst:39 21d314891c874db78c84b703ea0f06de
msgid ""
"``funder`` (string, null) (optional) Optional funder short name to filter"
" datasets. Examples: 'EC' (European Commission), 'NIH', 'NSF', 'ARC' "
"(Australian Research Council), 'WT' (Wellcome Trust), 'FCT' (Portugal), "
"'SNSF' (Swiss NSF)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/openaire_dataset_tools.rst:42 9c030f44650941e5aa1eacdfebe4a356
msgid ""
"``country`` (string, null) (optional) Optional ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country"
" code to filter by. Examples: 'DE' (Germany), 'FR' (France), 'IT' "
"(Italy), 'NL' (Netherlands), 'GB' (UK), 'ES' (Spain)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/openaire_dataset_tools.rst:45 1f5774009b944481bbd4d84464493bfc
msgid ""
"``size`` (integer) (optional) Number of results to return. Default 10, "
"maximum 100."
msgstr ""

